{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Jodi boli [F] tumi,        [G] Shei rod.. [Em]
[Am] Muthoy [F] vore,        [G] Chorai proti [Em] din
[Am] Tumi shei [F] bhore,        [G] Chokher [Em] kone
[Am] Tomay [F] chara,        [G] vabnara [Em] kothin
[Am] Tomake [F] debo na [C] harate,        [Dm] Hok ta alok borsho [Em] dur
[Am] Dube jabo [F] tomar [C] mon paray,        [Dm] Bedhecho hate hat [Em] rekhe
[F] Bondhu... [G] ... [C] ... [G] ... [Em],        [Am] Tumi [F] ekta
